{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤛᤢᤑᤥ","commonName":"ᤛᤢᤑᤥ","title":"ᤕᤢᤜᤢᤴᤏᤠᤖᤧ ᤏᤡ᤺ᤛᤢᤒᤠ ᤛᤢᤑᤥ","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"fecd46133e75bd47eb645280f500eb8d9e0cf837315af00323d1027d84fbb837","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":404},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["᥇᥆᥆᥆ ᤋᤱᤒᤣ ᤌᤠᤖᤡᤰ ᤁᤧᤏᤧᤒᤠ ᤜᤠᤱᤈᤢᤶ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤛᤠᤱᤃᤪᤠᤶᤐᤣᤍᤠᤱᤗᤠᤶ ᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤀᤡᤱᤒᤠᤎᤡᤰ ᤕᤧ᤺ᤖ ᤐᤳᤇᤧᤒᤠ ᤏᤡ᤺ᤛᤢᤱ॥ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤜᤢᤰᤁᤥ ᤂᤧᤴ ᤁᤢᤍᤪᤥ᤺ᤶ ᤔᤧ᤺ᤴᤏᤣᤒᤠ ᤗᤢᤶᤒᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤥᤒᤠ ᤋᤡᤔᤡᤰᤁᤡᤴ ᤏᤢ ᤐᤕᤶ ᤕᤶᤒᤠ ᤑᤧᤴᤌᤰᤁᤪᤱᤅᤡᤴ ᤁᤳᤋᤢᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤂᤧᤴ ᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤀᤡᤱᤒᤠᤸᤗᤧ ᤜᤴᤍᤃᤣ᤺ᤰᤃᤧᤴ ᤘᤠᤛᤣᤖᤡ᤺ᤴ ᤋᤧᤶᤛᤢᤀᤠᤱ ᤋᤱᤒᤣ ᤜᤧᤴᤇᤡᤱ (᥇᥆᥆᥆) ᤌᤠᤖᤡᤰ ᤂᤧᤴᤏᤡᤴ ᤀᤡᤄᤣ᤺ᤰᤂᤢᤖᤥ॥ ᤂᤧᤴ ᤜᤴᤍᤃᤣ᤺ᤰᤃᤧᤴ ᤘᤠᤛᤣᤖᤡ᤺ᤱᤃ ᤀᤢᤴᤇᤥ᤺ᤴᤒᤠ ᤀᤛᤣ᤺ᤰ. ᤔᤠᤑᤧᤴᤛᤠᤶ ᤀᤡᤃᤪ ᤛᤤᤋᤠ᤺ᤴᤏᤠᤱ ᤔᤧᤔᤧᤳᤋᤢᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤂᤧᤴ ᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤀᤡᤱᤒᤠᤸᤗᤧ ᤔᤠᤑᤧᤴᤛᤠᤶᤔᤡᤴ ᤁᤢᤍᤪᤥ᤺ᤶ ᤔᤧ᤺ᤴᤏᤣᤒᤠ ᤗᤢᤶᤒᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤥ ᤗᤠᤵᤑᤢᤛᤢ ᤁᤣ᤺ᤳᤋᤢ. ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤋᤱᤒᤣ ᤜᤧᤴᤇᤡᤱ (᥇᥆᥆᥆) ᤌᤠᤖᤡᤰ ᤀᤠᤳᤋᤡᤴ ᤔᤧᤴᤇᤠᤶ ᤛᤢᤘᤠᤱᤜᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤱᤗᤧᤰ ᤔᤧᤵᤔᤠ ᤔᤧᤛᤢᤰᤋᤢᤴᤇᤡᤴᤗ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤛᤢ᤺ᤵᤏᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤛᤢᤒᤢᤀᤠᤱ ᤀᤣ᤺ᤵᤛᤠᤵ ᤗᤰᤋᤢᤖᤥ॥ ᤂᤧᤴ ᤀᤣᤃᤠᤱ ᤛᤵᤑᤠᤖᤧ ᤗᤠᤃᤡ ᤂᤧᤴ ᤗᤧᤵᤔᤠᤀᤣ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱᤗᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤜᤠᤱᤕᤢᤰᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤏᤡ᤺ᤛᤢᤱᤛᤡᤱ॥ ᤂᤧᤵᤔᤥ ᤂᤠᤛᤧᤴ ᤗᤥ᤺ᤶᤔᤠ ᤕᤢᤰ ᤁᤧᤄᤥ᤺ᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤔᤧᤕᤢᤅᤧ॥ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤕᤧᤛᤢ ᤂᤪᤡᤛ᤻ᤋᤖᤧ ᤀᤥᤛᤣ᤺ᤴᤍᤠᤱ ᤆᤥᤃᤢᤒᤠ ᤛᤧᤰᤂᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤏᤢ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰᤁᤡᤴ ᤀᤡᤱᤓᤴ ᤔᤧᤈᤥᤃᤢᤒᤠᤸᤗᤧ ᤆᤥᤃᤢᤸᤗᤧ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤌᤧᤃ